<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Himel (Md. Habib Hasan Himel).">
  <section class="pt-2 prose-field">
    <h1 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Md. Habib Hasan Himel — MS candidate in Genetics and Plant
      Breeding at Sher-e-Bangla Agricultural University (SAU), Dhaka. My
      thesis looks at genetic variability, character association,
      correlation, and path coefficient analysis across blackgram
      (<em>Vigna mungo</em>) genotypes, supervised by Dr. Nahid Zeba.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside the lab, I build web software — full-stack platforms like a
      peer task/gig app for SAU and an agricultural supply-chain platform —
      and tinker with electronics and home automation on the side.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is where I write both up: research notes as they happen,
      and whatever I've been building. Reach me by email or find me on
      GitHub — links below.
    </p>
